  "job_B3.3.25_20251003_114713": {
    "chunk_text": "hnigan. & him ealle on hand eodan \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0nan leode, & be \u00feara Cristenra lare lifdon & fulwihte onfengon. & hie ongeaton geornlice \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m Cristenum leodum com Godes engel on fultum & on frofre. & \u00fea mid \u00fey \u00fee \u00fea Cristenan leode \u00fe\u00e6t wel sceawodan, \u00f0a gesawon hie & getealdon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s eac Hie \u00fea swa sigebeorhte & swa gebegde mid mycelre blisse to ham foran, & sona \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6lmihtigan \u00dea gemittan hie eac beforan \u00f0\u00e6re nor\u00f0dura \u00fe\u00e6re ciricean on \u00fe\u00e6m marmanstane swylce mannes & \u00fea fotlastas w\u00e6ron swutole & gesyne on \u00fe\u00e6m stane, swa hie on wexe w\u00e6ron a\u00f0yde. \u00dea ongeaton hie geornlice \u00fe\u00e6t se eadiga Michael \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s toweard him to fultome, \u00f0a hwile \u00f0e hie \u00e6t & him sylfa \u00fe\u00e6t tacn \u00fe\u00e6s siges gesette, & gecy\u00f0de into \u00fey swi\u00f0an sl\u00e6pe. On \u00f0\u00e6m stane hi \u00fea sona \u00f0\u00e6r ciricean ofergetimbredon & \u00fe\u00e6r weofod inne wlitelice geworhtan & & \u00fea stowe mid mycclum gefean seo\u00fe\u00fean weor\u00feodan & beeodan, hie \u00fea h\u00e6fdan miccle lufan & Ond eac healico ondrysnu \u00fea leode. & him w\u00e6s on mode myccle weorce & mycel tweo hw\u00e6t hie be \u00fe\u00e6re dorstan don, hwe\u00feer hie \u00fea Hie \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t to r\u00e6de \u00e6rest fundon, \u00fe\u00e6t hie ciricean ar\u00e6rdon be eastan \u00fe\u00e6re stowe,",
